Tolong paspornya...

583
00:32:08.639 --> 00:32:10.241
Formulir imigrasi...

584
00:32:12.671 --> 00:32:14.240
{\an8}Tolong lihat ke kamera, Nyonya.

585
00:32:12.671 --> 00:32:14.240
Please look into the camera, ma'am.

586
00:32:14.905 --> 00:32:16.406
{\an8}Tolong lihat ke kamera...

587
00:32:14.905 --> 00:32:16.406
Please look into the camera

588
00:32:19.538 --> 00:32:21.914
{\an8}Apa tujuan dari kunjungan anda ke Amerika?

589
00:32:19.538 --> 00:32:21.914
What is the purpose of your visit
to the United States?

590
00:32:22.238 --> 00:32:22.874
Apa?

591
00:32:22.971 --> 00:32:25.915
{\an8}Apa... tujuan... dari...
kunjungan... anda... ke... Amerika?

592
00:32:22.971 --> 00:32:25.915
What... is... the... purpose... of...
your... visit... to... the United States?

593
00:32:26.005 --> 00:32:28.005
{\an8}Saudara perempuanku menghadiri pernikahanku.

594
00:32:26.005 --> 00:32:28.005
My sister is attending my wedding.

595
00:32:28.804 --> 00:32:29.747
Apa?

596
00:32:35.304 --> 00:32:36.805
Ah... kau di sini untuk menghadiri pernikahan!

597
00:32:37.005 --> 00:32:37.846
Ya.

598
00:32:39.738 --> 00:32:40.715
Terima kasih.

599
00:32:45.237 --> 00:32:47.715
- Apa tujuan...
- Untuk membantu Amerika Serikat.

600
00:32:47.970 --> 00:32:49.243
Maaf?

601
00:32:49.404 --> 00:32:50.541
Ya... kau tahu...

602
00:32:50.638 --> 00:32:51.513
... untuk menghabiskan sedikit dolar...

603
00:32:51.571 --> 00:32:52.980
... membantu memulihkan perekonomian kalian.

604
00:32:53.704 --> 00:32:55.579
Kau tidak mau? Aku bisa kembali...

605
00:32:56.337 --> 00:32:59.543
Aku akan pergi ke tempat adik perempuan
untuk menghadiri pernikahan!

606
00:32:59.837 --> 00:33:02.441
- Bodohnya aku...
- Dengar...

607
00:33:03.637 --> 00:33:05.615
Jangan biarkan orang-orang ini
menakut-nakutimu...

608
00:33:05.770 --> 00:33:07.577
... sudah saatnya bagi mereka
untuk takut dengan kita.

609
00:33:07.970 --> 00:33:09.743
Ini kunjungan pertamamu ke AS...

610
00:33:10.470 --> 00:33:12.778
... dan pengalaman pertama
hanya terjadi sekali.

611
00:33:13.237 --> 00:33:15.714
Setiap pengalaman pertama adalah istimewa...

612
00:33:15.803 --> 00:33:17.576
... jadi nikmatilah...

613
00:33:18.603 --> 00:33:21.479
... dengan pasti,
tentu saja, dengan percaya diri!

614
00:33:22.603 --> 00:33:23.637
Semoga sukses!

615
00:33:28.970 --> 00:33:30.641
Bibi Shashi!

616
00:33:39.969 --> 00:33:41.470
Ibu... Ibu sudah sampai?

617
00:33:41.703 --> 00:33:43.271
Ibu sudah ada di mobil!

618
00:33:43.303 --> 00:33:44.246
Bagaimana kabarmu?

619
00:33:44.303 --> 00:33:45.803
Aku harap anak-anak tidak menyusahkan Ibu...

620
00:33:45.903 --> 00:33:46.812
Hai Ibu!

621
00:33:46.969 --> 00:33:47.878
Sagar!

622
00:33:52.903 --> 00:33:53.472
Bibi...

623
00:33:53.536 --> 00:33:55.639
... jangan khawatirkan Sapna,
Sagar dan paman...

624
00:33:55.736 --> 00:33:58.271
... kau kini berada di New York...
kita akan bersenang-senang!

625
00:33:58.469 --> 00:34:01.277
New York memiliki gedung-gedung
yang sangat tinggi, kan?

626
00:34:01.369 --> 00:34:02.279
Aku melihatnya dari pesawat...

627
00:34:02.369 --> 00:34:03.847
Shashi... itu Manhattan...

628
00:34:04.335 --> 00:34:06.711
Man... hat... tan?

629
00:34:06.802 --> 00:34:07.802
"Man" berarti...

630
00:34:07.869 --> 00:34:08.938
... aadmi (pria)...

631
00:34:09.669 --> 00:34:10.669
"Hat"... berarti...

632
00:34:10.702 --> 00:34:11.543
... topi (Bahasa Indonesia juga topi).

633
00:34:11.636 --> 00:34:14.273
Ibu... bahasa Hindi dari "tan" apa?

634
00:34:15.269 --> 00:34:16.770
"Tan"... berarti...

635
00:34:16.869 --> 00:34:17.846
... dhoop ki chaap (berjemur)!

636
00:34:17.869 --> 00:34:20.779
Aadmi... topi... dhoop ki chaap...
(Pria bertopi yang berjemur)

637
00:34:20.836 --> 00:34:22.972
Manhattan!
Besok aku akan membawa bibi ke sana.

638
00:34:25.269 --> 00:34:26.679
Terima kasih, Shashi...

639
00:34:27.769 --> 00:34:28.973
Terima kasih...?

640
00:34:29.602 --> 00:34:31.443
Baiklah... sama-sama.

641
00:34:33.536 --> 00:34:36.843
Aku tahu tidak mudah bagimu untuk datang...

642
00:34:38.202 --> 00:34:40.271
... tetapi siapa lagi yang kumiliki
selain dirimu.

643
00:34:42.535 --> 00:34:44.877
Sudah 10 tahun sejak Anil meninggal.

644
00:34:46.002 --> 00:34:48.707
Aku benar-benar merindukannya...

645
00:34:50.801 --> 00:34:51.972
Dasar lelaki egois!

646
00:34:52.868 --> 00:34:55.505
Aku sendirian yang harus melakukan
semuanya sekarang.

647
00:34:55.768 --> 00:34:56.837
Manu...

648
00:34:57.701 --> 00:35:01.543
Aku melihatmu dan
aku merasa sangat bangga...

649
00:35:02.668 --> 00:35:05.339
... memikirkan keadaan kita dulu...
dan keadaanmu sekarang!

650
00:35:07.902 --> 00:35:09.880
Masih ingat dengan
sekolah menengah Hindi kita?

651
00:35:12.334 --> 00:35:14.437
Kita sedikitpun tidak bisa
berbahasa Inggris...

652
00:35:14.501 --> 00:35:16.672
... sama sekali tidak bisa!

653
00:35:18.834 --> 00:35:20.005
Dan lihatlah dirimu sekarang...

654
00:35:20.501 --> 00:35:22.876
... kau memiliki karir
yang bagus di Amerika...

655
00:35:23.501 --> 00:35:25.445
... kau sendirian mengurus
2 anak perempuan.

656
00:35:28.268 --> 00:35:29.768
Anil... Anil...

657
00:35:30.268 --> 00:35:32.609
Jika dia tidak memberiku dorongan...

658
00:35:33.001 --> 00:35:34.603
Aku pastinya akan tetap sama.

659
00:35:35.268 --> 00:35:37.268
Aku begitu sangat merindukannya...

660
00:35:38.500 --> 00:35:39.910
... tapi syukurlah kau ada di sini!

661
00:35:41.433 --> 00:35:44.934
Bibi, ini indah sekali!

662
00:35:45.233 --> 00:35:46.609
Pilihan yang indah, Shashi!

663
00:35:46.700 --> 00:35:49.769
Pria... bertopi... yang berjemur

664
00:35:49.834 --> 00:35:53.277
Manhattan.

665
00:35:54.233 --> 00:35:57.336
Menyentuh surga, oh Tuhan!

666
00:35:57.400 --> 00:36:00.640
Manhattan.

667
00:36:00.966 --> 00:36:04.274
Jalan baru penuh kegembiraan

668
00:36:04.634 --> 00:36:07.736
Pertokoan yang dipenuhi mimpi

669
00:36:07.799 --> 00:36:12.244
Kejutan baru, di setiap perhentian

670
00:36:12.567 --> 00:36:14.408
Di sebelah kirimu adalah Prada

671
00:36:14.467 --> 00:36:16.240
Di sebelah kananmu adalah Zara

672
00:36:16.300 --> 00:36:19.800
Giorgio Armani,
Syukurlah sekarang ini hari Jumat!

673
00:36:19.900 --> 00:36:21.639
Gucci dan Versace,

674
00:36:21.666 --> 00:36:23.575
Jimmy Choc, Givenchy

675
00:36:23.633 --> 00:36:26.804
Diesel, Dior, Hokey Pokey,
Gap dan Bloomingdale

676
00:36:26.833 --> 00:36:30.504
Louis Vuitton

677
00:36:30.633 --> 00:36:33.770
Moschino

678
00:36:34.299 --> 00:36:38.437
Valentino...

679
00:36:43.499 --> 00:36:46.773
Begitu banyak untuk disampaikan
namun belum terucapkan

680
00:36:46.999 --> 00:36:50.341
Saat bersama-sama, namun terasa sendiri

681
00:36:50.432 --> 00:36:54.842
Kota yang hebat! Sedikit suasana hutan

682
00:36:58.665 --> 00:37:00.575
Jalan 5, 6, 7, 8

683
00:37:00.632 --> 00:37:02.372
Banyak sekali kaki dan sepatu

684
00:37:02.466 --> 00:37:04.239
Begitu banyak warna, dolar dolar

685
00:37:04.366 --> 00:37:05.843
rasa dari pidlee poo

686
00:37:05.899 --> 00:37:07.808
Sarapan untuk sepanjang hari

687
00:37:07.899 --> 00:37:09.638
Yang normal dan gay, mereka semua bergoyang

688
00:37:09.698 --> 00:37:12.904
dan Lexington, dan Madison,
semuanya begitu ooh!

689
00:37:12.965 --> 00:37:16.704
Frappuccino

690
00:37:16.732 --> 00:37:20.403
Mochaccino

691
00:37:20.498 --> 00:37:24.909
Cappuccino...

692
00:37:37.398 --> 00:37:38.808
Kau harus mengatakan balle balle
saat kau melakukan itu...

693
00:37:38.898 --> 00:37:40.570
Balle balle balle balle!

694
00:37:42.365 --> 00:37:44.240
Bibi... kau tidak makan...

695
00:37:44.365 --> 00:37:45.342
... makanannya tidak enak?

696
00:37:47.797 --> 00:37:49.469
Ini parantha benar-benar enak...

697
00:37:49.731 --> 00:37:52.005
Ini makanan Meksiko... Quesadilla...

698
00:37:52.231 --> 00:37:54.470
Apapun itu... rasanya enak!

699
00:37:54.964 --> 00:37:55.737
Apa? Apa yang dia katakan?

700
00:37:55.831 --> 00:37:57.309
{\an8}Dia hanya menyumpahimu.

701
00:37:55.831 --> 00:37:57.309
She just abused you.

702
00:37:58.998 --> 00:38:00.873
{\an8}Jadi katakan padaku tentang maharnya,
apa yang kalian berikan padaku?

703
00:37:58.998 --> 00:38:00.873
So tell me about the dowry,
what are you giving me?

704
00:38:00.964 --> 00:38:03.373
{\an8}- Apa yang kuberikan padamu?
- Kami bukan membelimu...

705
00:38:00.964 --> 00:38:03.373
- What am I giving you?
- We are not buying you...

706
00:38:03.597 --> 00:38:04.438
{\an8}... bukan seperti itu caranya.

707
00:38:03.597 --> 00:38:04.438
... that's not how it works.

708
00:38:04.531 --> 00:38:06.372
{\an8}Pihak lelaki yang memberikan mahar
kepada keluarga pihak perempuan.

709
00:38:04.531 --> 00:38:06.372
The Boy gives the girls family the dowry.

710
00:38:06.430 --> 00:38:07.806
{\an8}Dan hadiah yang sangat banyak sekali.

711
00:38:06.430 --> 00:38:07.806
And lots and lots of gifts.

712
00:38:08.364 --> 00:38:09.467
{\an8}Jadi aku nantinya akan bangkrut?

713
00:38:08.364 --> 00:38:09.467
So I'm going to go broke?

714
00:38:10.964 --> 00:38:13.532
Aku tidak tahu mengapa
tapi aku sangat mengantuk.

715
00:38:13.597 --> 00:38:14.973
Pergi tidurlah, sayang...

716
00:38:15.230 --> 00:38:15.867
Apakah tidak apa-apa?

717
00:38:15.931 --> 00:38:16.908
Ya, tentu saja.

718
00:38:18.898 --> 00:38:21.535
{\an8}Aku merasa sangat tidak enak...
dia pasti sangat kelelahan.

719
00:38:18.898 --> 00:38:21.535
I feel so bad...
she must be so tired.

720
00:38:22.697 --> 00:38:24.436
{\an8}Pasti karena jet lag.

721
00:38:22.697 --> 00:38:24.436
Must be the jet lag.

722
00:38:24.963 --> 00:38:26.305
Halo Satish...

723
00:38:26.764 --> 00:38:27.934
... bagaimana kabar anak-anak?

724
00:38:28.397 --> 00:38:29.568
Apakah mereka sudah pergi ke sekolah?

725
00:38:30.631 --> 00:38:31.972
Apakah mereka sudah membawa
kotak makan siang mereka?

726
00:38:35.796 --> 00:38:38.297
Cobalah untuk pulang ke rumah lebih awal...

727
00:38:42.264 --> 00:38:43.969
Aku merasa sedikit aneh di sini...

728
00:38:45.463 --> 00:38:46.964
... tanpa kalian semua...

729
00:38:47.429 --> 00:38:48.600
Shashi... nikmati saja...

730
00:38:48.630 --> 00:38:51.437
Aku akan masuk ke lift ...
kita bicara lagi nanti.

731
00:39:03.596 --> 00:39:04.869
Tidur nyenyak?

732
00:39:04.930 --> 00:39:07.533
Maaf... aku harus pergi ke kantor sebentar.

733
00:39:07.763 --> 00:39:09.707
Aku akan mencoba untuk pulang
secepat mungkin...

734
00:39:09.796 --> 00:39:11.603
... kita akan mulai menyusun
rencana pernikahannya.

735
00:39:12.429 --> 00:39:13.600
Hati-hati...

736
00:39:13.996 --> 00:39:15.497
Bye Sayang, sampai ketemu lagi!

737
00:39:18.263 --> 00:39:19.332
Selamat pagi, Bibi!

738
00:39:19.363 --> 00:39:21.341
Kau mau kubuatkan sarapan?

739
00:39:21.363 --> 00:39:22.500
Tidak, aku makan sereal saja.

740
00:39:25.595 --> 00:39:27.766
Apa yang akan bibi lakukan sendiri nanti?

741
00:39:27.962 --> 00:39:30.304
Kami memiliki saluran Zee TV
berbahasa Hindi, tapi...

742
00:39:30.529 --> 00:39:32.666
Aku punya ide, bagaimana kalau
bibi ikut denganku ke kampus!

743
00:39:33.662 --> 00:39:36.004
Apa yang akan aku lakukan di sana?

744
00:39:36.263 --> 00:39:37.672
Aku ada kuliah selama 2 jam...

745
00:39:37.695 --> 00:39:39.866
... dan bibi bisa santai di kafe...

746
00:39:39.929 --> 00:39:41.304
... dan aku akan menemui bibi di sana.

747
00:39:41.529 --> 00:39:43.507
Bibi punya uang... uang kecil?

748
00:39:43.529 --> 00:39:44.506
Ya.

749
00:39:44.996 --> 00:39:45.837
Dan jangan khawatir...

750
00:39:45.862 --> 00:39:47.305
... kalau saja bibi tersesat...

751
00:39:47.662 --> 00:39:53.197
... jika bibi tersesat, telepon saja aku.

752
00:39:53.695 --> 00:39:55.331
Jangan khawatir, pergilah.

753
00:39:55.695 --> 00:39:57.695
Taman di sini sangat indah...

754
00:39:57.795 --> 00:39:58.931
Washington Square Park...

755
00:39:59.295 --> 00:40:02.535
Washington... Square... Park...

756
00:40:02.595 --> 00:40:03.664
Bagus!

757
00:40:17.694 --> 00:40:20.638
Wow ... gaun yang anda kenakan sangat indah!

758
00:40:52.760 --> 00:40:54.829
{\an8}Wanita ini kasar sekali...

759
00:40:52.760 --> 00:40:54.829
This lady is so rude...

760
00:40:54.860 --> 00:40:57.202
{\an8}... pasti harinya sedang buruk.

761
00:40:54.860 --> 00:40:57.202
... must be having a bad day.

762
00:41:01.427 --> 00:41:02.927
{\an8}Bisakah aku memesan kopi biasa...

763
00:41:01.427 --> 00:41:02.927
Can I get a reguler coffee...

764
00:41:03.860 --> 00:41:04.769
{\an8}... dan muffin blueberry.

765
00:41:03.860 --> 00:41:04.769
... and a blueberry muffin.

766
00:41:04.860 --> 00:41:07.361
{\an8}Ini tanda terimamu...
silahkan ambil makananmu di sana...

767
00:41:04.860 --> 00:41:07.361
Here's your receipt...
please pick up your food over there...

768
00:41:07.427 --> 00:41:09.336
{\an8}Oke... semoga harimu menyenangkan.

769
00:41:07.427 --> 00:41:09.336
Okay... have a nice day.

770
00:41:10.227 --> 00:41:11.431
Berikutnya!

771
00:41:12.593 --> 00:41:13.900
{\an8}Apa kabarmu hari ini, Nyonya?

772
00:41:12.593 --> 00:41:13.900
How you doing today, ma'am?

773
00:41:14.426 --> 00:41:15.927
Aku mau...

774
00:41:16.360 --> 00:41:18.429
{\an8}Aku tadi bertanya apa kabarmu hari ini.

775
00:41:16.360 --> 00:41:18.429
I asked how you were doing today.

776
00:41:19.426 --> 00:41:22.233
Doing... I'm doing...
(Melakukan... aku melakukan...)

777
00:41:22.693 --> 00:41:24.261
I'm doing...
(Aku melakukan...)

778
00:41:26.927 --> 00:41:28.427
{\an8}Kau tidak bisa berlama-lama.

779
00:41:26.927 --> 00:41:28.427
You can't take all the time.

780
00:41:28.493 --> 00:41:29.937
{\an8}Antriannya masih panjang di sini.

781
00:41:28.493 --> 00:41:29.937
I got a long line here.

782
00:41:30.727 --> 00:41:32.727
Sorry... what to eat?
(Maaf... apa untuk makan?)

783
00:41:32.926 --> 00:41:34.904
{\an8}Kau bercanda denganku sekarang...

784
00:41:32.926 --> 00:41:34.904
Are you kidding me right now...

785
00:41:35.260 --> 00:41:36.761
{\an8}... tolong cepatlah, Nyonya.

786
00:41:35.260 --> 00:41:36.761
... please hurry up, lady.

787
00:41:39.393 --> 00:41:40.768
Vegetarian...

788
00:41:42.859 --> 00:41:44.531
{\an8}Vegetarian boleh saja...

789
00:41:42.859 --> 00:41:44.531
Vegetarian is fine...

790
00:41:44.826 --> 00:41:46.770
{\an8}... apa yang ingin kau makan?

791
00:41:44.826 --> 00:41:46.770
... what do you want to eat?

792
00:41:47.726 --> 00:41:48.931
Hanya vegetarian...

793
00:41:49.260 --> 00:41:51.669
Bagel... wrap... sandwich?

794
00:41:51.826 --> 00:41:52.769
Sandwich.

795
00:41:53.859 --> 00:41:55.734
{\an8}Dan jenis isi seperti apa
yang kau inginkan di dalamnya?

796
00:41:53.859 --> 00:41:55.734
And what kind of filling do you want inside?

797
00:41:55.759 --> 00:41:58.427
{\an8}Apakah kau mau keju...tomat... selada?

798
00:41:55.759 --> 00:41:58.427
Do you want cheese... tomatoes... lettuce?

799
00:42:00.492 --> 00:42:03.299
{\an8}Nyonya... kau membuat yang lain menunggu...

800
00:42:00.492 --> 00:42:03.299
Lady... you're holding up my line...

801
00:42:03.325 --> 00:42:04.735
{\an8}... ini bukan presentasi ilmiah.

802
00:42:03.325 --> 00:42:04.735
... this is not rocket science.

803
00:42:04.959 --> 00:42:06.231
Keju?

804
00:42:06.325 --> 00:42:07.496
Ya... keju...

805
00:42:07.792 --> 00:42:09.269
Ya untuk keju!

806
00:42:10.259 --> 00:42:11.498
Mau pesan minuman?

807
00:42:12.225 --> 00:42:13.259
Air...

808
00:42:13.325 --> 00:42:14.735
{\an8}Air putih atau soda?

809
00:42:13.325 --> 00:42:14.735
Still or sparkling?

810
00:42:15.659 --> 00:42:17.295
Hanya air.

811
00:42:19.325 --> 00:42:21.667
{\an8}Air putih atau soda?

812
00:42:19.325 --> 00:42:21.667
Still or sparkling?

813
00:42:24.259 --> 00:42:24.963
Kopi...?

814
00:42:25.992 --> 00:42:27.765
Americana? Cappuccino? Latte?

815
00:42:27.825 --> 00:42:29.394
Nyonya... aku tidak punya waktu seharian...

816
00:42:29.459 --> 00:42:33.994
Americana? Cappuccino? Latte?

817
00:42:34.658 --> 00:42:35.897
"Nescoffee".
(maksudnya Nescaffe)

818
00:42:36.758 --> 00:42:37.463
Apa?

819
00:42:37.492 --> 00:42:38.492
Nescoffee.

820
00:42:38.625 --> 00:42:39.967
{\an8}Ya kami memiliki kopi yang enak...

821
00:42:38.625 --> 00:42:39.967
Yes we have nice coffe...

822
00:42:40.225 --> 00:42:41.600
{\an8}... kami memiliki kopi yang terbaik
di Manhattan.

823
00:42:40.225 --> 00:42:41.600
... we have the best coffee in Manhattan.

824
00:42:41.658 --> 00:42:43.499
{\an8}Aku akan memberimu Americana saja.

825
00:42:41.658 --> 00:42:43.499
I'll just give you an Americana.

826
00:42:43.591 --> 00:42:44.796
Kecil atau sedang?

827
00:42:45.958 --> 00:42:46.992
Kecil.

828
00:42:47.325 --> 00:42:49.324
Kecil. Cuma itu?

829
00:42:49.992 --> 00:42:51.560
$ 10,20

830
00:42:51.892 --> 00:42:53.233
10 dolar...

831
00:43:11.458 --> 00:43:14.231
Halo... setidaknya yang bisa kau lakukan
adalah berterima kasih...!

832
00:43:14.291 --> 00:43:15.291
Maaf... terima kasih...

833
00:43:17.224 --> 00:43:18.634
Idiot bodoh!

834
00:43:19.291 --> 00:43:19.734
Maaf...

835
00:43:20.991 --> 00:43:22.798
Aku tidak mau membersihkan yang itu!

836
00:43:23.224 --> 00:43:24.565
Jangan repot-repot...

837
00:43:25.957 --> 00:43:27.696
Wanita yang bodoh sekali.

838
00:44:14.623 --> 00:44:15.600
Nyonya...

839
00:44:18.890 --> 00:44:20.458
Kopi-mu...

840
00:44:25.389 --> 00:44:27.594
... dari kedai kopi.

841
00:44:31.456 --> 00:44:33.593
Kafe tidak bagus...
(Kafenya tidak bagus)

842
00:44:34.456 --> 00:44:37.434
... wanita... tidak baik!
(pelayan wanitanya tidak ramah)

843
00:45:00.356 --> 00:45:01.799
Bibi!

844
00:45:01.855 --> 00:45:03.594
Tunggu... aku yang ke sana...

845
00:45:06.922 --> 00:45:09.490
Hati-hati... bisnya besar sekali.

846
00:45:09.522 --> 00:45:13.864
{\an8}Belajar berbahasa Inggris dalam waktu
empat minggu... yang benar saja!

847
00:45:09.522 --> 00:45:13.864
Learn to speak English in
for weeks... what a con!

848
00:45:14.922 --> 00:45:19.457
Apakah orang bisa belajar berbahasa Inggris
hanya dalam empat minggu?

849
00:45:19.688 --> 00:45:21.188
Itu cuma lelucon kan?

850
00:45:22.688 --> 00:45:24.324
Bibi bersenang-senang hari ini?

851
00:45:48.754 --> 00:45:55.528
Tolong periksa kode area dan coba lagi.

852
00:45:55.821 --> 00:45:57.765
Shashi... Shashi...!

853
00:45:58.321 --> 00:45:59.821
Sayang, ambilkan daftar Panditji cadangan...

854
00:45:59.854 --> 00:46:01.230
... dan musisi-musisi itu?

855
00:46:05.220 --> 00:46:06.892
Kita harus menemui pendeta Hindu besok.

856
00:46:06.921 --> 00:46:08.762
Pendeta Hindu Amerika?

857
00:46:08.854 --> 00:46:10.729
Bukan... mereka semua orang-orang kita...

858
00:46:11.320 --> 00:46:13.696
Pendeta Hindu Amerika...
ide yang keren, Bu.

859
00:46:13.754 --> 00:46:16.823
Mantra apa yang mereka lafalkan
di pesta pernikahan?

860
00:46:16.921 --> 00:46:18.557
"Om bhurbuvasvaha", apa lagi...

861
00:46:18.587 --> 00:46:20.861
Manu... itu Mantra Gayatri!

862
00:46:22.387 --> 00:46:23.592
- Ibu!
- Aku mencoba...

863
00:46:24.220 --> 00:46:25.993
Maukah kau menemui pendeta besok?

864
00:46:26.420 --> 00:46:28.591
- Ya tentu.
- Dia berbicara dalam bahasa Hindi asli.

865
00:46:29.686 --> 00:46:33.221
Simpan daftar nomor telepon ini bersamamu...

866
00:46:33.320 --> 00:46:35.923
... katering, dekorator, pendeta dll...

867
00:46:36.420 --> 00:46:40.364
... dan jika di Pune kalau kau menekan
kode "020" dulu sebelum menelpon...

868
00:46:40.420 --> 00:46:42.693
... kau harus menekan
kode area "212" di sini.

869
00:46:50.920 --> 00:46:52.397
Luar biasa!

870
00:46:52.419 --> 00:46:54.419
Makanan yang sangat lezat
setelah bertahun-tahun.

871
00:46:55.553 --> 00:46:56.758
Kunci rumah...

872
00:46:57.419 --> 00:46:59.226
... kalau kau merasa ingin jalan-jalan keluar.

873
00:47:00.386 --> 00:47:01.295
Pendetanya di sini.

874
00:47:01.319 --> 00:47:02.797
Ini adik perempuanku Shashi...

875
00:47:03.486 --> 00:47:05.657
... anda bisa membahas
semuanya dengan dia.

876
00:47:05.786 --> 00:47:06.763
Baiklah.

877
00:47:11.453 --> 00:47:13.488
Selamat Datang di NYLC...
ada yang bisa saya bantu?

878
00:47:14.253 --> 00:47:15.322
Halo...

879
00:47:16.286 --> 00:47:17.389
Kursus bahasa Inggris?

880
00:47:17.486 --> 00:47:18.623
Ya kelas bahasa Inggris.

881
00:47:21.286 --> 00:47:22.627
{\an8}Dengan siapa saya bicara?

882
00:47:21.286 --> 00:47:22.627
Who am I speaking to?

883
00:47:23.652 --> 00:47:24.755
Siapa nama anda?

884
00:47:24.819 --> 00:47:26.491
I... Shashi...
(Aku... Shashi...)

885
00:47:26.619 --> 00:47:27.892
Sha... Shaashi...?

886
00:47:28.386 --> 00:47:30.330
Nah Shaashi, apa yang bisa
saya lakukan untuk anda?

887
00:47:30.652 --> 00:47:34.596
How to... join class?
(Bagaimana untuk... bergabung kelas?)

888
00:47:34.819 --> 00:47:37.888
{\an8}Yah kami memiliki kelas "LSE4"
yang dimulai hari ini...

889
00:47:34.819 --> 00:47:37.888
Well we have an "LSE4" class
that starts today...

890
00:47:37.952 --> 00:47:39.759
{\an8}... kelas "LSE6" aka dimulai minggu depan...

891
00:47:37.952 --> 00:47:39.759
... an "LSE6" class starting next week...

892
00:47:39.819 --> 00:47:42.228
{\an8}... dan kelas "LSE8"
yang dimulai bulan depan...

893
00:47:39.819 --> 00:47:42.228
... and an "LSE8" class
that starts next month...

894
00:47:42.585 --> 00:47:43.654
LIC...?

895
00:47:43.752 --> 00:47:44.491
Oh... maaf...

896
00:47:44.552 --> 00:47:46.826
{\an8}"LSE4" adalah belajar berbahasa Inggris
dalam 4 minggu

897
00:47:44.552 --> 00:47:46.826
"LSE4" is Learn to Speak English in 4 weeks...

898
00:47:46.886 --> 00:47:49.329
{\an8}"LSE6" adalah Belajar berbahasa Inggris
dalam 6 minggu...

899
00:47:46.886 --> 00:47:49.329
"LSE6" is Learn to Speak English in 6 weeks...

900
00:47:49.385 --> 00:47:51.294
Nyonya... maaf...

901
00:47:51.385 --> 00:47:52.624
... lambat (perlahan)...

902
00:47:52.719 --> 00:47:53.991
Maaf

903
00:47:54.285 --> 00:47:58.252
Kelas "Belajar Berbahasa Inggris 4"...

904
00:47:58.452 --> 00:48:01.453
... adalah kelas selama 4 minggu...

905
00:48:01.719 --> 00:48:03.787
... dan akan dimulai hari ini.

906
00:48:04.285 --> 00:48:05.354
Hari ini!

907
00:48:06.552 --> 00:48:07.552
Uang?

908
00:48:07.684 --> 00:48:08.627
Oh maksud anda biayanya.

909
00:48:08.718 --> 00:48:11.492
Biayanya 400 dolar untuk kelas 4 minggu.

910
00:48:12.618 --> 00:48:13.823
400?

911
00:48:16.718 --> 00:48:17.787
Halo?

912
00:48:19.384 --> 00:48:20.361
Halo?

913
00:48:38.818 --> 00:48:40.818
Selamat Datang di NYLC...
apa yang bisa saya bantu?

914
00:48:41.217 --> 00:48:42.718

I Shashi...
(Aku Shashi...)

915
00:48:43.884 --> 00:48:45.328
... alamat?

916
00:48:45.484 --> 00:48:47.519
Jika anda menaiki kereta api...

917
00:48:48.484 --> 00:48:51.791
... turun di stasiun jalan 23.

918
00:48:53.551 --> 00:48:56.222
Letaknya dekat dengan gedung Flat Iron...

919
00:49:22.750 --> 00:49:25.591
Stasiun 23... satu tiket.

920
00:49:30.750 --> 00:49:31.886
Tunggu...

921
00:49:46.283 --> 00:49:47.885
Kereta api... stasiun 23?

922
00:49:47.949 --> 00:49:50.257
Tidak, tidak... di platform yang lain.

923
00:50:31.282 --> 00:50:33.260
Jalan 16?

924
00:50:48.414 --> 00:50:51.949
Setelah jalan nomor 23, adalah 24...

925
00:50:53.348 --> 00:50:56.451
... berarti 16 ada di sebelah sana...

926
00:50:56.548 --> 00:50:58.685
